  description: '2 Level 3 monsters

    Monsters your opponent controls cannot target
    face-up "Ghostrick" monsters, or any face-down Defense Position monsters, for
    attacks, except this one. You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card, then
    target 1 Set card your opponent controls; destroy that target. You can only use
    this effect of "Ghostrick Alucard" once per turn. If this card is sent to the
    Graveyard: You can target 1 other "Ghostrick" card in your Graveyard; add that
    target to your hand.'
